    </visualElement>
    <visualElement>
      <elementName>Text</elementName>
      <elementAttributes>
        <entry>
          <string>textFontSize</string>
          <int>14</int>
        </entry>
        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>Every cell not explicitly listed below is filled with 0 so that the machine safely defaults back to the IDLE state if something unexpected happens.

Row 0x00 (No high-register inputs active)
Column 0x00 (Address 0x00): 0 (Current state IDLE, stays IDLE)

Column 0x01 (Address 0x01): 1 (Current state INFERENCE, stays INFERENCE)

Column 0x02 (Address 0x02): 2 (Current state OUTPUT, stays OUTPUT)

Row 0x04 (user-submit is High)
Column 0x00 (Address 0x04): 1  &lt;-- CRITICAL: This kicks off the system! Moves IDLE to INFERENCE.

Column 0x01 (Address 0x05): 1 (Stays in INFERENCE)

Column 0x02 (Address 0x06): 2 (Stays in OUTPUT)

Row 0x08 (loop-ovf is High)
Column 0x00 (Address 0x08): 0

Column 0x01 (Address 0x09): 2  &lt;-- CRITICAL: Inference is done! Moves INFERENCE to OUTPUT.

Column 0x02 (Address 0x0A): 2 (Stays in OUTPUT)

Row 0x0C (user-submit AND loop-ovf both High)
Column 0x01 (Address 0x0D): 2 (Safety catch: prioritize moving to OUTPUT)

Row 0x10 (print-done is High)
Column 0x00 (Address 0x10): 0

Column 0x01 (Address 0x11): 1 (Stays in INFERENCE)

Column 0x02 (Address 0x12): 0  &lt;-- CRITICAL: Printing is done! Moves OUTPUT back to IDLE.</string>
        </entry>
      </elementAttributes>
      <pos x="400" y="-900"/>
    </visualElement>
